---
// PPO clipped objective L = min(r*A, clip(r, 1-e, 1+e)*A) for one sample, with e = 0.2 and advantage A = +2 or -2.
// r = new policy probability / old policy probability of the action taken. Checked in python3 (post notes).
const W = 900;
const H = 410;
const eps = 0.2;
const L = (r: number, A: number) => Math.min(r * A, Math.max(Math.min(r, 1 + eps), 1 - eps) * A);
const R0 = 0.4, R1 = 1.8;
const panels = [
  { A: 2, x0: 70, ymin: 0, ymax: 3.6, key: 'good' },
  { A: -2, x0: 510, ymin: -3.6, ymax: 0, key: 'bad' },
];
const PW = 320, PY = 80, PH = 200;
const px = (r: number, x0: number) => x0 + ((r - R0) / (R1 - R0)) * PW;
const py = (v: number, p: { ymin: number; ymax: number }) => PY + PH - ((v - p.ymin) / (p.ymax - p.ymin)) * PH;
const line = (f: (r: number) => number, p: any) => Array.from({ length: 71 }, (_, i) => {
  const r = R0 + (i * (R1 - R0)) / 70;
  return `${i ? 'L' : 'M'}${px(r, p.x0).toFixed(1)} ${py(f(r), p).toFixed(1)}`;
}).join(' ');
---
<figure class="p19-ppo">
  <div class="p19-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two small charts of the PPO clipped objective against the probability ratio, with clip range 0.8 to 1.2. Left: for an action with positive advantage 2, the objective rises with the ratio and goes flat at 2.4 once the ratio passes 1.2. Right: for negative advantage minus 2, the objective is flat at minus 1.6 below ratio 0.8 and falls steeply above it.">
      <text x="30" y="28" class="h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>PPO: do not move the policy too far in one update</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>PPO: không dịch policy quá xa trong một lần cập nhật</tspan>
      </text>
      {panels.map((p) => (
        <g>
          <rect x={p.x0 - 8} y={PY - 8} width={PW + 24} height={PH + 16} rx="8" class="panel" />
          <line x1={px(0.8, p.x0)} x2={px(0.8, p.x0)} y1={PY} y2={PY + PH} class="edge" />
          <line x1={px(1.2, p.x0)} x2={px(1.2, p.x0)} y1={PY} y2={PY + PH} class="edge" />
          <path d={line((r) => r * p.A, p)} class="raw" />
          <path d={line((r) => L(r, p.A), p)} class={p.key === 'good' ? 'clip' : 'clip bad'} />
          <text x={px(0.8, p.x0)} y={PY + PH + 30} text-anchor="middle" class="s">0.8</text>
          <text x={px(1.0, p.x0)} y={PY + PH + 30} text-anchor="middle" class="s">1.0</text>
          <text x={px(1.2, p.x0)} y={PY + PH + 30} text-anchor="middle" class="s">1.2</text>
          <text x={p.x0 + PW / 2} y={PY + PH + 50} text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>ratio r = new policy / old policy</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tỉ lệ r = policy mới / policy cũ</tspan></text>
        </g>
      ))}
      <text x="70" y="64" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Good action (advantage +2)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hành động tốt (advantage +2)</tspan></text>
      <text x="510" y="64" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Bad action (advantage −2)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hành động xấu (advantage −2)</tspan></text>
      <text x={px(1.45, 70)} y={py(2.4, panels[0]) - 8} class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>2.4</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2,4</tspan></text>
      <text x={px(0.45, 510)} y={py(-1.6, panels[1]) + 18} class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>−1.6</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>−1,6</tspan></text>
      <text x="30" y="372" class="s2"><tspan data-lang-en>Solid: clipped objective. Dashed: the unclipped r × advantage. Once r leaves [0.8, 1.2] in the helpful direction the gradient is zero.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nét liền: objective đã cắt. Nét đứt: r × advantage chưa cắt. Khi r ra khỏi [0,8; 1,2] theo hướng có lợi, gradient bằng 0.</tspan></text>
      <text x="30" y="394" class="s2"><tspan data-lang-en>Example: r = 1.5, advantage +2 gives min(3.0, 2.4) = 2.4. r = 1.5, advantage −2 gives min(−3.0, −2.4) = −3.0.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ví dụ: r = 1,5, advantage +2 cho min(3,0; 2,4) = 2,4. r = 1,5, advantage −2 cho min(−3,0; −2,4) = −3,0.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Say ε = 0.2. The clip caps how much credit one lucky batch can earn, which matters on markets where a single lucky stretch is easy to find.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giả sử ε = 0,2. Việc cắt giới hạn phần thưởng mà một batch may mắn có thể giành được, điều này quan trọng trên thị trường nơi một đoạn may mắn rất dễ gặp.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p19-ppo { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p19-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p19-ppo svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .p19-ppo text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p19-ppo .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-ppo .t { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-ppo .s { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p19-ppo .s2 { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-ppo .panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p19-ppo .edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .p19-ppo .raw { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .p19-ppo .clip { fill: none; stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 3; }
  .p19-ppo .clip.bad { stroke: var(--red); }
  .p19-ppo figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
